        var explicitNoFace = /screen recording|screen record|faceless|no face|sin cara|sin mostrar|stock footage|b-roll|animated|animation|motion comic|narrat|explained|facts?|top\s*\d+|iceberg|countdown|history of|story of|what happened|why did|how it works|breakdown|analysis|review|ranking|list|compilation|tutorial|true crime|tech|finance|education|psychology|motivation/i.test(textBlob.toLowerCase());
